	Also, I don't know if this is the case for other versions, but in
pl10 of the Mac port, shopkeepers charge you for using charges in a wand
even if you are want to buy the wand.  I was in a shop, picked up a wand and
tried to engrave with it.  It was a wand of wishing.  So I got a wish and
tried to pay for the wand.  The game said "Ashinopo charges you 666 zorkmids
for the use of the merchandise.  You don't have enough gold to pay for a
wand of wishing."  This strikes me as quite unfair.  I have no trouble with
being charged for testing wands that you don't buy, but it shouldn't charge
you for wands that you wish to purchase.

